"""
Creates the nano-v3 RL jsonl dataset by replacing placeholders with data fetched from Hugging Face datasets.

The nvidia/Nemotron-3-Nano-RL-Training-Blend contains a mix of NeMo Gym datasets and 2 open source math datasets:

- BytedTsinghua-SIA/DAPO-Math-17k
- Skywork/Skywork-OR1-RL-Data

The entries in the nvidia/Nemotron-3-Nano-RL-Training-Blend corresponding to these 2 datasets are placeholders that need to be
replaced with the actual data from these datasets. This script performs this replacement by downloading the data from
Hugging Face datasets and replacing the placeholders with the actual data. This script must be run before using the
nvidia/Nemotron-3-Nano-RL-Training-Blend for RL training.

Usage:
    chmod +x create_nanov3_jsonl.py
    ./create_nanov3_jsonl.py --input /path/to/nvidia/Nemotron-3-Nano-RL-Training-Blend/train.jsonl --output /path/to/output/train.jsonl
